commit 573b92b76282b4a4f42bd602d4ec442e683b7677
Author: bryaninjapan <paperworkbybryan@gmail.com>
Date:   Mon Aug 31 05:32:00 2026 +0900

    fix(phase-6): resolve warnings W-1 and W-2 in plan check
    
    W-1 (exception-safety): Add try/finally around setVisibleLogicalRange in chart-sync.js
       to ensure syncing flag always resets, even if apply throws. Adds test case 8
       to verify guard resets after exception.
    
    W-2 (real-browser proof): Document optional Playwright smoke test for SC2/SC3
       to automate two-chart lockstep verification beyond manual checkpoint.
    
    Both warnings addressed per plan-check recommendations; plans remain execution-ready.
    
